{
  "id": "789",
  "title": "You Misheard",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2019-09-05",
  "synopsis": "It’s hard to meet up when you mishear the directions.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1142/c3e9dbfd9cef6621520e5e3c3944e07e4adb2afc.mp3?1567416004",
  "series": {
    "title": "Ben’s life in China 6: Maybe I Like Him",
    "chapter": 20,
    "totalChapters": 29
  },
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "你听错了\n\n露西：喂，你好！你在哪儿？我没看见你。\n帅哥：我就在第三教学楼前面啊。你在哪儿？\n露西：你不是说你在七楼吗？我现在在七楼啊。\n帅哥：你听错了。我说，我在一楼。\n露西：啊，对不起！我听错了。那我现在下去，你等会儿。\n帅哥：好的。",
    "traditional": "你聽錯了\n\n露西：喂，你好！你在哪兒？我沒看見你。\n帥哥：我就在第三教學樓前面啊。你在哪兒？\n露西：你不是說你在七樓嗎？我現在在七樓啊。\n帥哥：你聽錯了。我說，我在一樓。\n露西：啊，對不起！我聽錯了。那我現在下去，你等會兒。\n帥哥：好的。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "You Misheard"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "露西：喂，你好！你在哪儿？我没看见你。",
      "traditional": "露西：喂，你好！你在哪兒？我沒看見你。",
      "pinyin": "lù xī wéi nǐ hǎo nǐ zài nǎ'r wǒ méi kàn jiàn nǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lucy: Hey, hello! Where are you? I don’t see you."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "帅哥：我就在第三教学楼前面啊。你在哪儿？",
      "traditional": "帥哥：我就在第三教學樓前面啊。你在哪兒？",
      "pinyin": "shuài gē wǒ jiù zài dì sān jiào xué lóu qián miàn a nǐ zài nǎ'r",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Handsome guy: I’m at the front of school building no. 3. Where are you?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "露西：你不是说你在七楼吗？我现在在七楼啊。",
      "traditional": "露西：你不是說你在七樓嗎？我現在在七樓啊。",
      "pinyin": "lù xī nǐ bú shì shuō nǐ zài qī lóu ma wǒ xiàn zài zài qī lóu a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lucy: Didn’t you say you were on the seventh floor? I’m on the seventh floor now."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "帅哥：你听错了。我说，我在一楼。",
      "traditional": "帥哥：你聽錯了。我說，我在一樓。",
      "pinyin": "shuài gē nǐ tīng cuò le wǒ shuō wǒ zài yī lóu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Handsome guy: You misheard. I said I’m on the first floor."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "露西：啊，对不起！我听错了。那我现在下去，你等会儿。",
      "traditional": "露西：啊，對不起！我聽錯了。那我現在下去，你等會兒。",
      "pinyin": "lù xī a duì bu qǐ wǒ tīng cuò le nà wǒ xiàn zài xià qù nǐ děng huì'r",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lucy: Ah, sorry! I misheard. Then I’m going down now, wait a moment."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "帅哥：好的。",
      "traditional": "帥哥：好的。",
      "pinyin": "shuài gē hǎo de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Handsome guy: Ok."
    }
  ],
